{"3329290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hoarfrost", "steam_appid": 3329290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoarfrost</strong> is an action-packed adventure  inspired by Dante's <i>Divine Comedy</i>, set in a dark world full of dangerous foes and treasures hidden deep beneath its surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated worlds:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a new world at any time, full of challenges and treasures!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to spend hours decorating your camp, setting up a farm, or perhaps rushing the most powerful boss armed with nothing but a wooden sword? Nothing holds you back!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming meets action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn't just about sharp blades and quick reflexes - it's also about your garden. Gather unique seeds in the depths and bring them to life on the surface to gain crucial buffs that tip the scales in your favour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/99fb720afc292c1a793e42edd255026d.poster.avif?t=1784655406\" width=640 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/99fb720afc292c1a793e42edd255026d.webm?t=1784655406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/99fb720afc292c1a793e42edd255026d.mp4?t=1784655406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark and thrilling atmosphere:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gripping atmosphere, so thick you could slice it with a knife!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/b5d0ef46629dd0ea7b37a873cbdaf949.poster.avif?t=1784655406\" width=640 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/b5d0ef46629dd0ea7b37a873cbdaf949.webm?t=1784655406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/b5d0ef46629dd0ea7b37a873cbdaf949.mp4?t=1784655406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op for up to 4 players:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a team in online co-op to share resources, combine plant powers and increase your chances of surviving the abyss! </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoarfrost</strong> is an action-packed adventure  inspired by Dante's <i>Divine Comedy</i>, set in a dark world full of dangerous foes and treasures hidden deep beneath its surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated worlds:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a new world at any time, full of challenges and treasures!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to spend hours decorating your camp, setting up a farm, or perhaps rushing the most powerful boss armed with nothing but a wooden sword? Nothing holds you back!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming meets action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn't just about sharp blades and quick reflexes - it's also about your garden. Gather unique seeds in the depths and bring them to life on the surface to gain crucial buffs that tip the scales in your favour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/99fb720afc292c1a793e42edd255026d.poster.avif?t=1784655406\" width=640 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/99fb720afc292c1a793e42edd255026d.webm?t=1784655406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/99fb720afc292c1a793e42edd255026d.mp4?t=1784655406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark and thrilling atmosphere:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gripping atmosphere, so thick you could slice it with a knife!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/b5d0ef46629dd0ea7b37a873cbdaf949.poster.avif?t=1784655406\" width=640 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/b5d0ef46629dd0ea7b37a873cbdaf949.webm?t=1784655406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329290/extras/b5d0ef46629dd0ea7b37a873cbdaf949.mp4?t=1784655406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op for up to 4 players:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a team in online co-op to share resources, combine plant powers and increase your chances of surviving the abyss! </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Embark on an adventure into an absurd world inspired by the Divine Comedy! Stop the lurking monsters 